WEBVTT

00:03.620 --> 00:06.750
<b>Well, that left me speechless.
Right, Chief?</b>

00:06.750 --> 00:11.720
<b>Wounded or not, to think that he dispatched
the Heavenly Father God NousGalia just like that!</b>

00:11.720 --> 00:14.930
<b>I can see why he’s the Demon King’s
right-hand man.</b>

00:15.180 --> 00:17.890
<b>Is NousGalia still in Aharthern?</b>

00:17.890 --> 00:23.520
<b>Yes. But he’s on the brink of death.
Which was also part of the plan.</b>

00:23.520 --> 00:26.270
<b>I just don’t understand gods.</b>

00:26.480 --> 00:29.480
<b>But divine power is absolute.</b>

00:29.480 --> 00:33.650
<b>So the Blaze Death King can simply assume
the Heavenly Father God’s identity.</b>

00:33.900 --> 00:37.950
<b>I thought that the spell
to usurp divine power was still incomplete?</b>

00:37.950 --> 00:43.960
<b>It’s sufficient. Avos Dilhevia should
be able to complete it.</b>

00:43.960 --> 00:46.750
<b>Using the Hero Kanon’s plan?</b>

00:46.750 --> 00:51.960
<b>NousGalia is attempting to produce an entity
that’s both the Child of God and a Great Spirit.</b>

00:51.960 --> 00:55.590
<b>The Demon King of Tyranny,
Avos Dilhevia.</b>

00:55.800 --> 00:59.220
<b>In other words, you’re going
to borrow the fake Demon King’s power...</b>

00:59.220 --> 01:01.260
<b>...to possess NousGalia instead?</b>

01:01.260 --> 01:03.520
<b>If circumstances call for it.</b>

01:07.150 --> 01:09.360
<b>The Hero is about to come face
to face with the Great Spirit Mother...</b>

01:09.360 --> 01:12.110
<b>...and the Demon King’s right-hand man.</b>

01:12.110 --> 01:16.570
<b>Now, then... I wonder how that meeting will go?</b>

01:21.030 --> 01:26.620
<b>From what he just said, seems like Kanon
has started spreading rumors about Avos Dilhevia.</b>

01:26.620 --> 01:27.920
<b>It won’t be long.</b>

01:27.920 --> 01:31.210
<b>Considering it’s a half-spirit,
half-demon life form, most likely...</b>

01:31.750 --> 01:33.380
<b>Then... what about Leno?</b>

01:33.380 --> 01:35.300
<b>Don’t avert your gaze, Misha.</b>

01:35.300 --> 01:39.300
<b>That’s precisely why we came all this way—
to see this through.</b>

01:42.140 --> 01:43.390
<b>I respectfully decline.</b>

01:43.390 --> 01:48.230
<b>Shin Reglia. This is how we can save
the Demon King... Anos.</b>

01:48.370 --> 01:53.420
<b>09 - A PRAYER FOR TWO THOUSAND YEARS LATER</b>

01:48.480 --> 01:52.650
<b>The humans are preparing to kill Anos
when he reincarnates 2,000 years from now.</b>

01:53.110 --> 01:55.990
<b>Knowing him, he’ll handle them
with contemptuous ease.</b>

01:56.440 --> 02:00.700
<b>But would you force the Demon King to attack
humans again, when he doesn’t wish to fight?</b>

02:01.570 --> 02:05.540
<b>When he’s reincarnated, I want the world
that he sees to be a peaceful one.</b>

02:05.950 --> 02:08.080
<b>To make sure that happens,
I’ll play the role of the Demon King.</b>

02:08.500 --> 02:09.870
<b>With you as my right-hand man—</b>

02:09.870 --> 02:15.050
<b>No matter the circumstances, do you think
that I’d kneel down before a fake Demon King?</b>

02:15.130 --> 02:21.220
<b>If you’re by my side, everyone will believe
Avos Dilhevia to be the true Demon King.</b>

02:21.220 --> 02:22.640
<b>If you really care about Anos...</b>

02:24.640 --> 02:29.600
<b>It doesn’t matter who schemes against him.
My lord will overcome them all.</b>

02:29.940 --> 02:31.690
<b>And he will lose nothing.</b>

02:32.230 --> 02:36.440
<b>You’d leave it all to him just because
he’s transcended us all?</b>

02:36.780 --> 02:38.150
<b>It’s because we’re so weak...</b>

02:38.490 --> 02:40.780
<b>It’s because we weren’t strong enough
to stop the hatred...</b>

02:41.200 --> 02:43.780
<b>...that his only choice was solitary slumber!</b>

02:44.830 --> 02:49.500
<b>I’ll make amends for it all 2,000 years from now
with my death at the hands of the humans.</b>

02:49.750 --> 02:53.000
<b>Surely that should stop this chain of enmity.</b>

02:54.380 --> 02:59.090
<b>I promised him. That the next time we
were reborn, it would be as friends.</b>

03:00.010 --> 03:00.880
<b>I...</b>

03:02.180 --> 03:07.220
<b>I want to be worthy of calling myself
his friend the next time I stand before him.</b>

03:09.310 --> 03:13.770
<b>Whatever happens, I would never turn
a blind eye to a bogus Demon King.</b>

03:16.020 --> 03:20.860
<b>That said, your reckless plan
will never succeed.</b>

03:21.200 --> 03:25.490
<b>I will reincarnate myself.
I will follow my lord 2,000 years into the future.</b>

03:26.370 --> 03:30.580
<b>I guess that means that he can’t help you,
but he won’t thwart you, either?</b>

03:36.090 --> 03:37.050
<b>Thanks.</b>

03:37.670 --> 03:39.420
<b>You’ve changed a little, Kanon.</b>

03:40.340 --> 03:42.840
<b>You used to always have
an anguished look on your face,</b>

03:42.840 --> 03:45.010
<b>but now it looks like
you’ve gotten over it.</b>

03:45.350 --> 03:47.930
<b>If that’s true,
then it must be thanks to Anos.</b>

03:48.390 --> 03:51.140
<b>Is it thanks to you that he changed?</b>

03:52.230 --> 03:52.890
<b>What?</b>

03:53.350 --> 03:55.270
<b>I came here expecting to be slashed...</b>

03:55.560 --> 03:58.110
<b>But I’ve never seen him so devoid
of murderous intent.</b>

03:58.110 --> 04:01.900
<b>Is that right? Maybe teaching him
about love is paying off?</b>

04:02.360 --> 04:03.780
<b>You’re teaching him?</b>

04:06.160 --> 04:12.120
<b>Oh, right. You know, I didn’t think that
the Great Spirit Mother would ever fall in love.</b>

04:16.210 --> 04:17.670
<b>Love...</b>

04:18.000 --> 04:19.920
<b>I see, so it’s love!</b>

04:24.300 --> 04:26.050
<b>Shin!</b>

04:26.050 --> 04:27.100
<b>What’s the matter?</b>

04:27.550 --> 04:30.140
<b>I know now.
I know what it is, Shin!</b>

04:30.520 --> 04:33.100
<b>I’m in love with you, Shin.</b>

04:33.100 --> 04:36.440
<b>It was love all along.
I’ve fallen in love with you, Shin.</b>

04:36.690 --> 04:40.110
<b>Whenever I’m with you,
I always feel different.</b>

04:41.360 --> 04:43.820
<b>When you told me
that you didn’t know what love was,</b>

04:43.820 --> 04:45.450
<b>it made my heart ache...</b>

04:45.910 --> 04:49.780
<b>...and when you watered the flowers,
I couldn’t stop smiling...</b>

04:50.410 --> 04:54.250
<b>You always make me feel like a new person.</b>

04:54.580 --> 04:58.210
<b>Someone who’s not the Great Spirit Mother.</b>

04:59.000 --> 05:01.250
<b>Is that annoying?</b>

05:02.090 --> 05:03.970
<b>There is no love in me.</b>

05:06.180 --> 05:10.890
<b>But you’ve filled the emptiness
inside me just a bit.</b>

05:11.310 --> 05:13.140
<b>The days I’ve spent with you here...</b>

05:13.140 --> 05:17.270
<b>It’s like I was given a scabbard
during that time. I am grateful.</b>

05:17.520 --> 05:19.560
<b>No, no, that’s all right.</b>

05:19.900 --> 05:21.770
<b>And today those days will come to an end.</b>

05:22.110 --> 05:23.030
<b>What?</b>

05:23.610 --> 05:26.280
<b>I’ve eradicated the final Divine Beast Gwen.</b>

05:26.280 --> 05:28.780
<b>And NousGalia is now only half-alive.</b>

05:28.780 --> 05:31.700
<b>He no longer has sufficient strength
to lay a hand on you.</b>

05:31.700 --> 05:34.620
<b>So you’re going to reincarnate yourself? When?</b>

05:36.210 --> 05:40.380
<b>The Hero Kanon will soon start spreading
rumors about the fake Demon King.</b>

05:40.790 --> 05:43.340
<b>Before that happens...
I will be heading to Dilhade.</b>

05:44.380 --> 05:48.220
<b>But I... I finally realized...</b>

05:48.550 --> 05:53.180
<b>Forgive me. My lord awaits me,
2,000 years in the future.</b>

05:55.480 --> 05:56.560
<b>That’s not fair.</b>

05:58.020 --> 05:59.520
<b>Not fair? How?</b>

05:59.520 --> 06:02.820
<b>Because the Demon King got
to be with you for a long time, right?</b>

06:03.190 --> 06:05.280
<b>I only just met you the other day.</b>

06:05.280 --> 06:07.530
<b>How can I ever top that?</b>

06:08.700 --> 06:11.990
<b>Then as a token of my gratitude,
and to keep it fair,</b>

06:11.990 --> 06:14.830
<b>I shall give you something
to take to the place of those days.</b>

06:14.830 --> 06:16.500
<b>What are you going to give me?</b>

06:16.500 --> 06:18.080
<b>Whatever you wish.</b>

06:20.210 --> 06:21.630
<b>Then, Shin...</b>

06:22.210 --> 06:29.470
<b>Um... could you... marry me?</b>

06:31.930 --> 06:33.300
<b>Understood.</b>

06:36.220 --> 06:42.690
<b>Then go on now. I’ll be waiting here
for 2,000 years... until you return.</b>

06:44.690 --> 06:45.570
<b>Leno.</b>

06:45.940 --> 06:48.190
<b>Which style of wedding do you prefer?</b>

06:48.530 --> 06:50.820
<b>Don’t you have to leave now?</b>

06:50.820 --> 06:55.740
<b>My lord says that all married people
must have held a marriage ceremony.</b>

06:55.740 --> 06:59.460
<b>Okay, then, I think I’d like the Aharthern style.</b>

07:00.290 --> 07:01.290
<b>Very well.</b>

07:02.960 --> 07:03.840
<b>Okay.</b>

07:12.390 --> 07:14.930
<b>- Wedding!
- Wedding!</b>

07:14.930 --> 07:16.640
<b>So joyous!</b>

07:16.970 --> 07:18.140
<b>Congratulations!</b>

07:18.810 --> 07:20.100
<b>Beautiful.</b>

07:20.310 --> 07:23.270
<b>But they sure got married fast, huh?</b>

07:25.940 --> 07:28.860
<b>If only Anos could’ve been here, too.</b>

07:28.860 --> 07:30.990
<b>Agreed... however...</b>

07:31.530 --> 07:34.120
<b>He may be watching from 2,000 years in the future.</b>

07:34.450 --> 07:36.950
<b>After all, my lord is the Demon King of Tyranny.</b>

07:37.620 --> 07:40.120
<b>A Spirit and a Demon joined in matrimony.</b>

07:40.120 --> 07:44.130
<b>Let us be thankful that we were able
to be here at such a momentous time.</b>

07:44.420 --> 07:49.710
<b>Great Spirit Mother Leno.
Do you take Shin Reglia as your husband,</b>

07:49.710 --> 07:54.140
<b>and promise in the name of the spirits
to devote yourself to him with unwavering faith...</b>

07:54.140 --> 07:58.060
<b>...until this lore expires?</b>

07:58.060 --> 07:59.060
<b>I do.</b>

07:59.390 --> 08:02.520
<b>Shin Reglia, the Demon King’s right-hand man.</b>

08:02.520 --> 08:05.860
<b>Do you take the Great Spirit Leno as your wife,</b>

08:05.860 --> 08:08.820
<b>and with the pride and willpower of the demon clan,</b>

08:08.820 --> 08:14.700
<b>do you promise to protect her as you would
your own country with unwavering faith?</b>

08:15.070 --> 08:17.830
<b>Even if we are separated by destruction.</b>

08:18.160 --> 08:25.500
<b>The husband of the Great Spirit Mother Leno,
the Spirit King, Shin Reglia, has now been created.</b>

08:25.790 --> 08:28.590
<b>And now, you may kiss to seal these promises.</b>

08:31.010 --> 08:32.720
<b>You can just pretend.</b>

08:32.720 --> 08:33.970
<b>You want me to pretend?</b>

08:36.720 --> 08:39.470
<b>Well, I’d rather you didn’t.</b>

08:40.100 --> 08:41.680
<b>Then that’s what I’ll do.</b>

08:44.640 --> 08:46.060
<b>I love you.</b>

08:48.190 --> 08:48.860
<b>I...</b>

08:50.650 --> 08:54.240
<b>It’s okay. Because I love you enough
for both of us.</b>

08:55.910 --> 08:58.700
<b>I don’t understand what love is yet...</b>

08:58.700 --> 09:01.580
<b>But I have chosen you, Leno.</b>

09:10.170 --> 09:13.460
<b>What a commotion, right?
These Spirit-style weddings.</b>

09:13.460 --> 09:16.970
<b>It’s a more solemn affair for you demons,
so it must’ve surprised you.</b>

09:17.260 --> 09:18.970
<b>I am not averse to it.</b>

09:19.300 --> 09:23.220
<b>As someone who knows nothing of love,
I am grateful to you...</b>

09:23.220 --> 09:24.560
<b>...for allowing me to dream like this.</b>

09:24.560 --> 09:28.230
<b>Uh... I’m sure it’s not as if you know nothing.</b>

09:29.770 --> 09:36.700
<b>There’s a tiny, tiny bud inside your heart, Shin,
and one day, it will bloom.</b>

09:38.570 --> 09:41.910
<b>I only wish that I could’ve continued
to dream like this forever.</b>

09:41.910 --> 09:42.910
<b>What?</b>

09:42.910 --> 09:46.460
<b>But the wedding has ended without a hitch.</b>

09:47.000 --> 09:48.620
<b>Uh, wait...</b>

09:48.960 --> 09:50.380
<b>Not yet!</b>

09:51.090 --> 09:52.590
<b>Not over yet.</b>

09:52.590 --> 09:54.130
<b>Wedding night! Wedding night!</b>

09:54.550 --> 09:57.550
<b>Hey, you! Tithis!</b>

09:57.550 --> 09:59.340
<b>Retreat! Retreat!</b>

09:59.340 --> 10:01.180
<b>Have a good one!</b>

10:04.430 --> 10:06.180
<b>Oh, uh... listen...</b>

10:06.180 --> 10:07.100
<b>Yes?</b>

10:07.100 --> 10:09.900
<b>I mean, it is our wedding night.</b>

10:10.480 --> 10:13.610
<b>But it’s okay if you just want to sleep.</b>

10:13.610 --> 10:15.280
<b>Then do you wish to go to bed now?</b>

10:15.740 --> 10:18.900
<b>Uh... why don’t we chat for a bit?</b>

10:18.900 --> 10:22.330
<b>I’d like to hear about
how you and Anos met.</b>

10:22.660 --> 10:25.410
<b>It’s not really that interesting a story.</b>

10:31.290 --> 10:35.210
<b><i>During the Great War,</i>
<i>I had already acquired a physical body...</i></b>

10:35.500 --> 10:38.420
<b><i>...and was testing my skills</i>
<i>against some eminent demons.</i></b>

10:39.260 --> 10:42.140
<b><i>Every one of my opponents felt like</i>
<i>a weakling to me.</i></b>

10:43.140 --> 10:44.930
<b><i>They all had love...</i></b>

10:44.930 --> 10:47.520
<b><i>...which just wasn’t suitable for battle.</i></b>

10:47.520 --> 10:51.810
<b><i>I may have wielded such power because</i>
<i>I had no love in my heart.</i></b>

10:52.310 --> 10:57.150
<b><i>Each victory felt empty to me,</i>
<i>and I constantly felt parched.</i></b>

10:57.530 --> 11:01.910
<b><i>For what, I had no way of knowing at the time.</i></b>

11:02.240 --> 11:07.160
<b><i>And then one day, I found myself facing off</i>
<i>against someone known as the Demon King.</i></b>

11:12.540 --> 11:14.670
<b><i>I unleashed one hundred swords,</i></b>

11:14.670 --> 11:17.420
<b><i>but I never got close</i>
<i>to slashing the Demon King.</i></b>

11:18.130 --> 11:21.680
<b><i>For the first time ever,</i>
<i>I found myself interested in my enemy.</i></b>

11:23.720 --> 11:25.850
<b>What makes you strong?</b>

11:25.850 --> 11:27.680
<b>I have to be strong to save everyone.</b>

11:28.520 --> 11:31.060
<b>Tell me, what makes you so strong?</b>

11:31.060 --> 11:32.520
<b>No reason at all.</b>

11:34.110 --> 11:35.900
<b>Come serve me.</b>

11:36.190 --> 11:40.360
<b>I’ll give you an opponent worthy
of being slashed by your sword.</b>

11:43.530 --> 11:45.700
<b>I realized then for the first time...</b>

11:46.120 --> 11:52.870
<b>That I had been seeking a master worthy
of owning me... the evil god-killing sword.</b>

11:55.420 --> 11:57.880
<b>Anos sure is amazing.</b>

11:57.880 --> 12:01.380
<b>My lord gave me a reason to fight,</b>

12:01.380 --> 12:04.260
<b>and welcomed me into the clan as a demon.</b>

12:04.760 --> 12:09.560
<b>To repay him for that kindness,
I became the Demon King’s right-hand man.</b>

12:10.060 --> 12:11.430
<b>I see.</b>

12:12.520 --> 12:17.400
<b>No wonder you want to go after him
and reincarnate yourself.</b>

12:20.030 --> 12:22.700
<b>Um... listen, Shin.</b>

12:22.700 --> 12:27.240
<b>I... I don’t think I want
to just sleep tonight, after all.</b>

12:28.740 --> 12:33.580
<b>I may end up hurting you...
if it’s love that you seek.</b>

12:34.420 --> 12:36.130
<b>Don’t worry about it!</b>

13:02.030 --> 13:02.900
<b>Leno!</b>

13:04.860 --> 13:07.110
<b>I heard that you suddenly collapsed.</b>

13:07.110 --> 13:09.950
<b>Yes. Maybe I got too carried away?</b>

13:11.160 --> 13:14.500
<b>Enyunien’s taking a look at me now.</b>

13:14.870 --> 13:18.830
<b><i>Hmm... how am I supposed to explain this?</i></b>

13:18.830 --> 13:19.920
<b>What’s the matter?</b>

13:20.210 --> 13:25.130
<b><i>The thing is... Lady Leno,</i>
<i>it seems as if you’re with child.</i></b>

13:25.220 --> 13:26.180
<b>What?</b>

13:26.550 --> 13:30.640
<b><i>I can sense a demon’s magic power from you.</i></b>

13:30.640 --> 13:34.060
<b><i>There’s no question,</i>
<i>it’s your child with the Spirit King.</i></b>

13:34.060 --> 13:38.150
<b>But I thought spirits and demons
could never have children together?</b>

13:38.480 --> 13:44.610
<b>Hmm... that’s what I always believed...
but facts are facts.</b>

13:44.900 --> 13:46.200
<b>I see.</b>

13:46.530 --> 13:52.950
<b><i>But the rumors and lore that make up</i>
<i>this child’s source are still tiny and weak.</i></b>

13:52.950 --> 13:56.370
<b>I’m sure that they’re newborn rumors.</b>

13:56.370 --> 13:58.830
<b>I can’t even get a sense
of what kind of rumors they are.</b>

13:59.120 --> 14:04.000
<b><i>Your source is compensating</i>
<i>for what the child lacks.</i></b>

14:04.000 --> 14:06.760
<b><i>That must be why you collapsed.</i></b>

14:06.760 --> 14:11.640
<b><i>You must find and spread these rumors</i>
<i>and lore within ten months and ten days,</i></b>

14:11.640 --> 14:16.060
<b><i>or else the child may expire soon after birth.</i></b>

14:16.270 --> 14:17.690
<b>That’s a relief.</b>

14:17.690 --> 14:19.270
<b>What do you mean?</b>

14:19.270 --> 14:21.810
<b>Well, we have ten months and ten days.</b>

14:21.810 --> 14:24.320
<b>That should be more than enough time.</b>

14:24.320 --> 14:26.990
<b>Because I’m the Great Spirit Mother.</b>

14:28.950 --> 14:30.530
<b>Thank you, Shin!</b>

14:31.570 --> 14:32.530
<b>Why?</b>

14:32.740 --> 14:36.040
<b>Because this child is the love you gave me.</b>

14:36.450 --> 14:39.000
<b>A miracle that your love brought about.</b>

14:39.370 --> 14:42.290
<b>You made sure that I wouldn’t feel lonely.</b>

14:43.250 --> 14:45.590
<b>I want you to name the child.</b>

14:46.840 --> 14:51.300
<b>If it’s a boy, Gord.
If it’s a girl... Misa.</b>

14:51.300 --> 14:53.050
<b>Those are both good names!</b>

14:54.720 --> 14:57.520
<b>Leno... if you want, I—</b>

14:57.520 --> 15:01.350
<b>No way am I ever going to say, “Don’t go.”</b>

15:01.850 --> 15:04.610
<b>My husband is the Demon King’s right-hand man.</b>

15:04.610 --> 15:06.820
<b>More loyal than anyone else in the world.</b>

15:06.820 --> 15:11.490
<b>You of all people would never stand by
and let the fake Demon King’s rumors spread.</b>

15:14.780 --> 15:16.370
<b>I am grateful to you.</b>

15:27.340 --> 15:28.340
<b>Shin!</b>

15:30.970 --> 15:33.970
<b>“The Love Fairy, Fran,
lends physical bodies to the dead.”</b>

15:34.260 --> 15:39.310
<b>“The reincarnated lose their memories,
but only those who share true love...”</b>

15:39.310 --> 15:41.980
<b>“...are able to remember
and convey those memories.”</b>

15:42.650 --> 15:44.360
<b>Why are you giving this to me?</b>

15:44.360 --> 15:47.150
<b>See, this is a Spirit spell.</b>

15:47.150 --> 15:51.490
<b>So that we can be reunited in 2,000 years.
Whatever you do, don’t lose it!</b>

15:52.110 --> 15:53.360
<b>I promise not to.</b>

15:54.660 --> 15:58.580
<b>I’ll be waiting for you with this child.
Go on—see you later!</b>

15:59.040 --> 16:00.960
<b>I will return without fail.</b>

16:21.060 --> 16:23.850
<b><i>Are you sure about this?</i></b>

16:23.850 --> 16:25.100
<b>About what?</b>

16:25.100 --> 16:27.440
<b><i>Great Spirit Mother Leno...</i></b>

16:27.440 --> 16:34.910
<b><i>Your lore states that you are ever</i>
<i>and always solely the mother of all spirits.</i></b>

16:35.110 --> 16:38.910
<b><i>But that child is a half-demon.</i></b>

16:38.910 --> 16:44.920
<b><i>If you give birth to it, it will contradict your</i>
<i>rumors and lore, and you’ll die as a result.</i></b>

16:45.250 --> 16:47.880
<b>I’m going to have this child.
No matter what.</b>

16:48.090 --> 16:51.460
<b>You must protect whomever
it is that you wish to protect.</b>

16:53.470 --> 16:57.090
<b><i>2,000 years from now,</i>
<i>when he hears of your demise,</i></b>

16:57.090 --> 17:01.470
<b><i>it may cause the Spirit King much sorrow.</i></b>

17:01.890 --> 17:04.140
<b>We can just let Shin cry, then.</b>

17:04.140 --> 17:06.650
<b>If he does,
then I’m sure it’ll hit him.</b>

17:07.190 --> 17:09.860
<b>That he did love me.</b>

17:09.860 --> 17:12.570
<b>Though that might be
a mean way of looking at it.</b>

17:12.570 --> 17:16.490
<b>I’ve fallen in love.
So I want him to love me, too.</b>

17:17.110 --> 17:21.580
<b>If I’m going to make that big lunk look my way,
then the least I can do is risk my life.</b>

17:22.580 --> 17:23.870
<b><i>Hmm...</i></b>

17:23.870 --> 17:27.960
<b>Don’t worry. We’ve already witnessed one miracle,
so why shouldn’t there—</b>

17:29.880 --> 17:32.670
<b><i>The evil god-killing sword gave you love?</i></b>

17:34.300 --> 17:36.470
<b><i>That’s beyond comical!</i></b>

17:39.140 --> 17:40.220
<b>Don’t do it!</b>

17:40.220 --> 17:41.560
<b>You can’t reincarnate!</b>

17:41.560 --> 17:43.100
<b>Where have you been hiding yourselves?</b>

17:43.100 --> 17:44.220
<b>Inside the page!</b>

17:44.480 --> 17:45.980
<b>Let’s head back to Aharthern!</b>

17:45.980 --> 17:46.810
<b>We’ve got to go back!</b>

17:47.230 --> 17:48.650
<b>If this is another one of your pranks—</b>

17:48.650 --> 17:49.730
<b>She’s going to vanish!</b>

17:49.730 --> 17:51.650
<b>Leno’s going to disappear!</b>

17:52.190 --> 17:53.150
<b>Leno...</b>

17:55.990 --> 17:57.450
<b>NousGalia.</b>

17:58.030 --> 18:00.370
<b>Great Spirit Mother Leno.</b>

18:00.370 --> 18:03.080
<b>Let me enlighten you, ignorant one.</b>

18:03.700 --> 18:07.000
<b><i>I told that evil god-killing sword.</i></b>

18:07.620 --> 18:14.050
<b>He seems to think that he slashed my words.
But a god’s words are absolute.</b>

18:14.050 --> 18:15.510
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

18:15.510 --> 18:19.050
<b>It’s not love that causes miracles to happen.</b>

18:19.260 --> 18:22.640
<b>The love that the evil god-killing sword yearned for...</b>

18:22.640 --> 18:25.770
<b>...the love that the Great Spirit Mother Leno
came to know...</b>

18:25.770 --> 18:28.640
<b>Not to mention the miraculous seed
that you’re carrying...</b>

18:28.640 --> 18:31.980
<b>All exist thanks to the Heavenly God Father’s order.</b>

18:32.400 --> 18:33.190
<b>That’s a lie.</b>

18:33.190 --> 18:38.740
<b>That child is not Shin Reglia’s.
His body was used as a medium.</b>

18:38.950 --> 18:41.700
<b><i>You’re wrong!</i>
<i>This child is mine and Shin’s for sure!</i></b>

18:45.370 --> 18:47.790
<b>This is the page that was added.</b>

18:48.210 --> 18:51.380
<b>Avos Dilhevia... spirit...?</b>

18:52.000 --> 18:55.550
<b>I’m sure you can see it clearly.</b>

18:55.880 --> 19:00.970
<b>That this child’s source is comprised
of the fake Demon King’s rumors and lore.</b>

19:01.970 --> 19:07.220
<b>Now, then! The Child of God, who will destroy
the Demon King Anos, is about to be born!</b>

19:09.810 --> 19:13.770
<b>Stop it... if they’re born now,
they won’t survive! Oh...</b>

19:15.400 --> 19:19.440
<b>No! No, you can’t do this! Not yet!</b>

19:20.530 --> 19:25.740
<b>Her source and her magic power are still weak.
Do nothing, and she’ll be destroyed.</b>

19:26.080 --> 19:29.160
<b>What will you do,
Great Spirit Mother Leno?</b>

19:31.830 --> 19:37.380
<b>Please... be born...
The spirit who can save this child...</b>

19:41.720 --> 19:46.220
<b>There you are!
Please, Ezyssey, the Spring of Time!</b>

19:46.220 --> 19:50.600
<b>Please take her with you...
where she can live...</b>

19:50.600 --> 19:55.440
<b>Because the Demon King will surely save her
2,000 years from now...</b>

19:59.740 --> 20:04.030
<b>I’m sorry... that I couldn’t even hold you in my arms.</b>

20:04.030 --> 20:08.200
<b>That child is neither this love that you speak of,
nor Shin Reglia’s child.</b>

20:08.200 --> 20:11.160
<b>So why would you save her?</b>

20:11.660 --> 20:15.210
<b>According to the divine word,
you are the mother of the Child of God and—</b>

20:17.750 --> 20:22.300
<b>Evil god-killing sword...
it’s no use killing me now...</b>

20:24.380 --> 20:25.220
<b>Leno!</b>

20:25.760 --> 20:26.720
<b>Shin...</b>

20:27.010 --> 20:28.310
<b>Please forgive me.</b>

20:28.600 --> 20:31.810
<b>Thank you... for protecting me.</b>

20:32.520 --> 20:36.770
<b>Sorry... Shin... I lied to you.</b>

20:37.270 --> 20:41.570
<b>It wasn’t love...
it wasn’t a miracle at all...</b>

20:42.190 --> 20:44.910
<b>She wasn’t your child...</b>

20:45.360 --> 20:48.830
<b>I couldn’t teach you love...
I’m sorry.</b>

20:50.410 --> 20:53.660
<b>That child will be going 2,000 years into the future.</b>

20:54.080 --> 20:59.210
<b>If she ever poses a threat to the peace of the world...
please kill her yourself...</b>

21:00.340 --> 21:01.510
<b>Understood.</b>

21:02.590 --> 21:04.260
<b>I will protect her, no matter what.</b>

21:05.090 --> 21:09.180
<b>I will create a world in which she can survive,
even 2,000 years from now.</b>

21:09.550 --> 21:11.850
<b>But... you can’t...</b>

21:11.850 --> 21:15.980
<b>That child’s rumors
and lore are Avos Dilhevia’s...</b>

21:15.980 --> 21:19.520
<b>I can’t let you...
I can’t let you do that, Shin...</b>

21:19.730 --> 21:22.900
<b>I will not let her die.
Even if she betrays...</b>

21:23.990 --> 21:28.990
<b>Even if she betrays my lord, I will spread
the fictional Demon King’s rumors and lore,</b>

21:28.990 --> 21:30.740
<b>and protect that child.</b>

21:32.790 --> 21:34.910
<b>Because Misa is our child.</b>

21:35.750 --> 21:38.330
<b>She’s the precious love that you gave me.</b>

21:38.630 --> 21:40.000
<b>Shin...</b>

21:41.040 --> 21:46.720
<b><i>Why... can’t I speak anymore?</i>
<i>There are so many things I still want to tell you...</i></b>

21:47.130 --> 21:53.770
<b><i>I’m sorry, Shin. I’m your wife...</i>
<i>and yet you’re always protecting me...</i></b>

21:53.770 --> 21:56.390
<b><i>But I couldn’t protect your pride...</i></b>

21:56.890 --> 21:59.810
<b><i>You were the one thing I prized</i>
<i>more than anything...</i></b>

22:02.980 --> 22:04.820
<b>It’s not working out as I’d hoped.</b>

22:05.440 --> 22:08.860
<b>I caused you grief at the very end...
I am so sorry.</b>

22:10.280 --> 22:11.830
<b><i>You’ve got to smile.</i></b>

22:12.410 --> 22:16.290
<b><i>Listen, Shin. Not that I think</i>
<i>I’m getting through to you...</i></b>

22:16.830 --> 22:18.790
<b><i>But thank you, Shin.</i></b>

22:18.790 --> 22:21.250
<b><i>For teaching me about love.</i></b>

22:21.630 --> 22:25.210
<b><i>Thank you, Shin. For protecting me.</i></b>

22:27.050 --> 22:30.470
<b><i>We were only married for three days...</i></b>

22:30.470 --> 22:34.220
<b><i>But I was happier than anyone else in the world.</i></b>

22:51.780 --> 22:55.450
<b>I suppose that I’m the epitome of a fool.</b>

23:07.880 --> 23:10.220
<b>I wanted to make you happy.</b>

23:26.570 --> 23:30.400
<b>The tragedy that happened 2,000 years ago is over.</b>

23:31.200 --> 23:34.410
<b>We’re going to go get it all back!</b>

23:35.680 --> 23:40.000
<b>SEND HATRED TO THE PAST</b>

23:37.950 --> 23:40.000
<b><i>Send Hatred to the Past.</i></b>
